  "pipeline_call": "tokenizer(prompt, padding=\"max_length\", max_length=77, truncation=True)",
  "pipeline_passes_attention_mask_to_text_encoder": false,
  "pad_token_note": "CLIPTokenizer's pad_token is '!' which is vocab id 0, NOT the eos id 49407 that openai/clip-vit-* checkpoints pad with. SD 2.x / sd-turbo therefore pads the tail of the 77-token window with 0, and because CLIP's attention is causal-only (no padding mask is passed) those pad positions still produce nonzero embeddings that the UNet cross-attends to."
